For **each** of the 4 `submitted` assessments: ⋮ → **Progress Update** → click **Approve**

| Action | Status Transition | Backend |
|---|---|---|
| ⋮ → **Progress Update** → **Approve** | `submitted → reviewed` | `POST /risk-assessments/{id}/review/` with `{action:"approve"}` |
| ⋮ → **Progress Update** → **Reject** | `submitted → draft` | `POST /risk-assessments/{id}/review/` with `{action:"reject"}` |

> **Reject path:** Clicking **Reject** returns the assessment to `draft` so the IA can revise and re-submit.

**Expected:** All 4 assessments now have status `reviewed`.

