### Full Status Workflow Summary:

| Step | Done by | UI Action | Status | Backend endpoint |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | IA | Create assessment | `draft` | `POST /risk-assessments/` |
| 2 | **IA** | Progress Update → **Submit for Review** | `draft → submitted` | `POST /risk-assessments/{id}/submit/` |
| 3 | **CIA** | Progress Update → **Approve** | `submitted → reviewed` | `POST /risk-assessments/{id}/review/` `{action:"approve"}` |
| 4 | **IA** | Progress Update → **Approve & Finalize** | `reviewed → approved` | `POST /risk-assessments/{id}/submit/` |

> **Terminal state:** `approved` — the ⋮ Progress Update option is hidden for approved assessments.

