> **Login as:** `auditor@fcc.go.tz` / `Pass@1234`
>
> The plan detail page shows **Resource Allocation — Staff / Audit Hours / Budget — `—`** (blank). This is correct for a freshly generated draft. The IA must fill these before submitting for approval.

