> **Login as:** `auditor@fcc.go.tz` / `Pass@1234`
>
> Use this **only** for supplementary or ad-hoc plans outside the normal risk cycle. For the standard annual RBIAP, always use **Generate from Risk Assessments** above.

**Page:** Sidebar → **Audit Plans** → Click **"Create Audit Plan"**

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **Reference Number** | *(leave empty — auto-generates as `RBIAP-{year_code}-{sequence}`)* |
| **Plan Title** | `Risk-Based Internal Audit Plan 2025/2026` |
| **Plan Type** | `annual` |
| **Fiscal Year** | `2025/2026` |
