### ✅ Verification Checklist

**After creating the declaration:**
- [ ] Declaration row visible in the Declarations card with status `pending`
- [ ] `declarant_name` shows correctly
- [ ] `has_conflict` badge: green **Independent** (Declaration A) or red **Has Conflict** (Declaration B)
- [ ] (Backend) `document_id` is not null → PDF was uploaded to DRS

**After signing:**
- [ ] Row shows status badge `signed`
- [ ] `signed_at` timestamp visible in the detail dialog
- [ ] **Sign Declaration** button is gone from the dialog

**After all declarations are signed — GAP 9 / SRS Req 18 + 38 (stamp trigger):**
- [ ] Declaration detail dialog shows a **"View stamped declaration ↗"** link
- [ ] Clicking it opens a PDF with QR code at bottom-left and the CIA's signature image at bottom-right on the last page
- [ ] Scanning the QR code opens: `https://{domain}/verify/declaration/{declaration_id}/`

