### Full Status Workflow Reference

| Step | Action | Fields Editable | Result |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Create** | Engagement, Type, Title, Date, Time, Location, Agenda | `scheduled` |
| 1a | *(Optional)* **Progress Update** → `cancelled` | — | `cancelled` *(terminal)* |
| 2 | **Progress Update** → `in_progress` | — | `in_progress` |
| 2a | *(Optional)* **Progress Update** → `cancelled` | — | `cancelled` *(terminal)* |
| 3 | **Edit** (⋮ menu) | Minutes, Key Discussions, Clarifications *(pre_exit only)*, Agreed Observations *(pre_exit only)*, Attendees, Minutes Doc upload, Attendance Sheet upload | Post-meeting data saved |
| 4 | **Progress Update** → `completed` | — | `completed` |

> **⚠️ `MINUTES_REQUIRED`** — Minutes must be non-empty before `completed` is allowed.
> **⚠️ `DUPLICATE_MEETING_TYPE`** — Second active meeting of same type per engagement is blocked (GAP-4).
> **⚠️ `PRE_EXIT_REQUIRES_APPROVED_WPS`** — Pre-exit blocked if no approved WPs exist (GAP-8).
> **⚠️ `cancelled` and `completed` are terminal** — no further transitions possible.
> **✅ On `completed`** — GAP-9 auto-generates PDFs to DRS: entry/exit → minutes + attendance; pre_exit → minutes only; team → nothing.

